<section class="section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2 style="font-size: 56px;">THE SACRED KAPILA LEGACY</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 20px; font-style: italic;">We don't manufacture Ghee. We preserve an ancient Vedic lineage.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; margin-top: 60px;">
      <div>
        <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/about-1.jpg" alt="Our Farm" style="border-radius: 8px;">
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Lost Art of Vedic Nutrition</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">At Worldsno1bestghee, we believe that modern machinery destroys the life force (Prana) of food. That's why we stick to the 3,000-year-old Bilona method.</p>
        <p>Our Kapila cows are not kept in stalls. They are forest-grazed, feeding on medicinal herbs and wild grass, resulting in milk that is rich in nutrients and healing properties.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 30px; margin-top: 80px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="background: var(--color-white); padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-gold); font-size: 64px; margin-bottom: 10px;">30L</h2>
        <p style="font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">Milk per 1L Ghee</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--color-white); padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-gold); font-size: 64px; margin-bottom: 10px;">100%</h2>
        <p style="font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">Forest Grazed</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

